sequenceDiagram
  participant S as Scheduler
  participant L as Lifecycle Manager
  participant H as Execution Host
  participant P as Policy Engine
  participant O as Observability
  S->>L: create(job grant)
  L->>P: reauthorize
  P-->>L: allow
  L->>H: create microVM/VM
  H-->>L: attestation
  L->>H: install exact egress policy
  H-->>L: ready
  L->>O: lifecycle events
  L->>H: isolate and destroy
  H-->>O: destruction evidence
